  "details": "From my experience—when using an Xbox game-pad, the horizontal dead-zone for the right stick is very high. This makes the required amount of input for looking side-to-side very high, and it feels very clunky, especially since the dead-zone threshold for vertical input is fine. Now, I make this feedback without having done much research about wether there already are ways to fix this issue, so I'm merely reporting what I have experienced.",
